# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [qiskit_addon_utils](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/) "
"package provides some reusable functionalities for various purposes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pachetul [qiskit_addon_utils](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/) "
"oferă funcționalități reutilizabile pentru diverse scopuri.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Its [qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators.html) module provides functions to generate Heisenberg-like Hamiltonians on a given connectivity graph.\n"
"This graph can be either a [rustworkx.PyGraph](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.PyGraph.html) or a [CouplingMap](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap) making it easy to use in Qiskit-centric workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Modulul său [qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators.html) oferă funcții pentru generarea de Hamiltonieni de tip Heisenberg pe un graf de conectivitate dat.\n"
"Acest graf poate fi fie un [rustworkx.PyGraph](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.PyGraph.html), fie un [CouplingMap](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap), ceea ce îl face ușor de utilizat în fluxuri de lucru centrate pe Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the following, we first generate a heavy-hex `CouplingMap` out of which "
"we carve a linear chain of 10 qubits. Note, that the indices of this new "
"`reduced_coupling_map` are again zero-based.\n"
msgstr ""
"În continuare, generăm mai întâi un `CouplingMap` de tip heavy-hex din care "
"extragem un lanț liniar de 10 Qubiți. Notă: indicii acestui nou "
"`reduced_coupling_map` sunt din nou bazați pe zero.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![Code output](/img/qiskit-addons/obp/01-getting-started/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Code output](/img/qiskit-addons/obp/01-getting-started/output_1.png)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we generate a Pauli operator modeling a Heisenberg XYZ Hamiltonian.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apoi, generăm un operator Pauli care modelează un Hamiltonian Heisenberg "
"XYZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\\hat{H} = \\sum_{(j,k)\\in E} (J_{x} \\sigma_j^{x} \\sigma_{k}^{x} +\n"
"    J_{y} \\sigma_j^{y} \\sigma_{k}^{y} + J_{z} \\sigma_j^{z} \\sigma_{k}^{z}) +\n"
"    \\sum_{j\\in V} (h_{x} \\sigma_j^{x} + h_{y} \\sigma_j^{y} + h_{z} \\sigma_j^{z})$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\\hat{H} = \\sum_{(j,k)\\in E} (J_{x} \\sigma_j^{x} \\sigma_{k}^{x} +\n"
"    J_{y} \\sigma_j^{y} \\sigma_{k}^{y} + J_{z} \\sigma_j^{z} \\sigma_{k}^{z}) +\n"
"    \\sum_{j\\in V} (h_{x} \\sigma_j^{x} + h_{y} \\sigma_j^{y} + h_{z} \\sigma_j^{z})$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Where $G(V,E)$ is the graph of the coupling map provided.\n"
msgstr "Unde $G(V,E)$ este graful hărții de cuplare furnizate.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From the qubit operator, we can generate a quantum circuit which models its time evolution.\n"
"Once again, the [qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators.html) module comes to the resuce with a handy function do just that:\n"
msgstr ""
"Din operatorul de Qubiți, putem genera un circuit cuantic care modelează evoluția sa în timp.\n"
"Din nou, modulul [qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators.html) vine în ajutor cu o funcție utilă exact pentru asta:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/obp/01-getting-"
"started/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/obp/01-getting-"
"started/output_2.png)\n"

